@startuml activity
' Exp 3C - Generate evacuation plan (services/planning.py generate_initial_plan + engine/allocate.py).
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|Coordinator|
start
:Choose strategy (Greedy / Min-Cost Flow);
:POST /evacuations/generate;
|Planning service|
if (Caller has plan:generate?) then (no)
  :Return 403;
  stop
endif
:Load zones, households, shelters,\nroutes, vehicles from PostgreSQL;
|Engine|
:Group households into demand groups\n(zone x needs);
:Compute priority per group (FR-06)\nrisk, severity, vulnerable members;
:Build zone -> shelter edges;
:Apply hard constraints (FR-07)\nclosed shelter, blocked route,\nno free capacity, missing facility,\nwalk > max_walk_km;
:Rank feasible edges by weighted cost (FR-08)\nweights from PlanningConfig;
if (Strategy?) then (Greedy)
  :Assign highest priority first\nto cheapest feasible shelter;
else (Min-Cost Flow)
  :Solve min-cost flow (SPFA)\nwith unallocated penalty;
endif
:Dispatch vehicles; medical / accessibility\ngroups need a suitable vehicle;
:Compute metrics and explanations;
|Planning service|
:Save EvacuationPlan + PlanVersion v1 (Proposed);
:Save assignments, vehicle and\nresource allocations (FR-09);
:Write AuditLog + Notification (FR-12);
:Publish "changed" over WebSocket;
|Coordinator|
:See plan, map and "why" explanations;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  :POST /versions/1/approve\n(role-gated);
endif
stop
@enduml
